\v 6 Everywhere you \add people\add* live¦335374, cities¦335375 will be \add ≈turned to rubble\add* and the \add ≈hilltop¦335377 shrines¦335374\add* ruined¦335381, so that your altars will be \add ≈broken down and left idle\add*. Then they'll be broken and disappear, your pillars will be cut¦335386 down, and \add ≈everything you people have built\add* will be wiped¦335388 away.
