\v 9 Then those who escape¦335410 will think about me among¦335412 the nations¦335412 where¦335413 they'll be held captive¦335414. \add ≡They'll remember¦335409\add* that I was grieved by their promiscuous heart¦335421 that turned¦335425 away from me, and¦335409 by their eyes¦335428 that \add ≈lusted¦335429\add* after¦335430 their idols¦335431. Then the loathing¦335432 for the wickedness¦335436 that they've committed with¦335412 all their \add ≈disgusting activities\add* will show on¦335412 their faces¦335433,
\v 10 and¦335442 they'll know¦335442 that I am Yahweh¦335446. It was for a reason that I said I'd bring this evil onto them.’ ”
