\v 16 But¦335797 some survivors¦335798 will escape¦335797 from among them, and¦335799 will go up into the hills. Like the doves¦335803 \add that live in¦335808\add* the valleys¦335804, all of them will moan—each person for their¦335798 \add own\add* disobedience.
