\v 26 Disaster¦335934 \add ≈will follow\add* disaster¦335937 and there'll be rumour after rumour. Then they'll \add ≈be wanting\add* a vision¦335945 from the prophet¦335946, but¦335939 the priest¦335949 will \add ≈no longer teach\add* \add God's\add* \add ≈instructions¦335947\add*, and advice from the elders¦335951 \add ≡will be useless\add*.
