\p
\v 1 Then in \add ≈the middle of\add* the sixth¦335978 year¦335977,\f + \fr 8:1 \ft About fourteen months later—around mid-September 592 B.C.\f* as I sat in my house¦335984, and Yehudah's¦335986 elders¦335985 sat \add ≈in front¦335988 of\add* me, my master¦335993 Yahweh's¦335994 hands fell¦335989 on¦335977 me there¦335991 again.
\v 2 I looked, and wow—there was \add ≈something that looked a bit like\add* a man. From his hips downward¦336004 there appeared to be fire, and from his hips upward¦336007 there appeared to be something shining¦336012 like glowing metal.\x + \xo 8:2: \xt Eze 1:27.\x*
\v 3 Then¦336014 he reached out something in the shape of a hand¦336016 and took me by my hair¦336018—the Spirit lifted¦336020 me up between earth¦336026 and the heavens¦336028, and in visions¦336032 from God¦336033, he took me to Yerushalem¦336031, to the entrance of the inner¦336038 northern¦336040 gate¦336037, where¦336041 the idol was that¦336039 made \add Yahweh\add* very \add ≈jealous\add*.
\p
\v 4 Then¦336049 wow, the \add ≈brilliant light\add* of Yisrael's god¦336053 was there¦336051, just like the vision¦336055 that¦336056 I'd seen¦336057 on¦336058 the plain¦336058.\x + \xo 8:4: \xt Eze 1:28.\x*
\v 5 Then¦336060 he told me, “Humanity's child, \add ≈look towards\add* the north.” \add ≈So¦336060\add* I \add ≈looked towards\add* the north, and¦336060 to the north of the gate¦336077 leading to the altar¦336078—there in¦336082 the entrance¦336082—was the idol \add that caused the\add* jealousy¦336080.
\p
\v 6 \add ≈So¦336084\add* he told me, “Humanity's child, do you see what they're doing? Those are \add ≈horribly disgusting things\add* that¦336096 the \add ≈Israeli¦336097 people\add* are doing here to \add ≈drive¦336103\add* me far from my own sanctuary¦336105. \add ≈But¦336084\add* you'll see even more disgusting \add things\add* \add soon\add*.”
\p
\v 7 Then he took me to the courtyard¦336118 doorway, and I looked¦336119, and \add ≈there was\add* a hole in¦336124 the wall¦336124.
