\v 1 Then¦336363 \add ≈I heard\add* \add @Yahweh\add* call out with¦336364 a loud voice¦336365, saying, “Guards, come up to the city¦336370, and¦336363 each \add ≈one is to bring his destructive¦336373\add* weapon¦336372.”
