\p
\v 1 As I looked toward the dome that was over the heads of the winged creatures, something appeared¦336616 above them \add ≈that looked like a sapphire¦336615 stone¦336614 that had been made into\add* a throne¦336618.\x + \xo 10:1: \xt Eze 1:26; Rev 4:2.\x*
