\v 26 Its¦343146 priests do violence¦343147 to my law, and they profane my sacred things. They don't distinguish¦343156 between sacred and profane things, and don't teach the difference between \add ≈what God approved and what he didn't¦343155\add*. They \add ≈ignore\add* my rest days so I \add end up\add* getting mocked among¦343167 them.\x + \xo 22:26: \xt Lev 10:10.\x*
