\v 10 They uncovered¦343364 her nakedness¦343365, took¦343368 her sons and daughters¦343367, and killed¦343371 her with¦343370 the sword¦343370. She'd become notorious among¦343375 women¦343375, so they executed judgement¦343376 on¦343370 her.
