\v 15 wearing belts around their waists¦343435, with¦343435 flowing turbans¦343437 on¦343435 their heads¦343438. All of them looked like chariot troop officers¦343440, similar to Babylonians (whose native¦343448 land¦343447 is Chaldea¦343446).
