\v 17 The Babylonians came¦343460 to her and to her bed¦343465 of lust, and they defiled her with¦343469 their¦343469 promiscuity. \add Yes,\add* she'd defiled herself by what she'd done, \add ≈so\add* she turned¦343473 herself away from them in¦343469 disgust.
