\v 20 and she¦343506 lusted¦343506 for her¦343508 lovers¦343508 whose private parts were \add long\add* like those of donkeys¦343512, and whose emissions of semen were \add huge\add* like those of stallions.
\v 21 That's how you did those shameful things \add ≈when you were young¦343521\add*, when the Egyptians \add ≈fondled\add* your nipples¦343524 and¦343518 \add ≈squeezed¦343522\add* your young¦343527 breasts¦343526.
