\v 34 You'll drink¦343722 \add @that cup of suffering\add* and drain¦343724 it empty, then¦343722 you'll shatter it and tear your breasts¦343729 with the pieces¦343727. That's the master¦343735 Yahweh's¦343736 declaration.’
\p
